Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "진짜 귀여워!!"
}

### 댓글 수정
PUT http://localhost:3000/comment/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "수정된 댓글 내용입니다!"
}

### 댓글 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/comment/3